{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id1301563953"}, "name":{"label":"Mirhossein.Mousavi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-09T11:40:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"11931435989"}, "title":{"label":"It's not worth the money"}, "content":{"label":"This app just adds a widget to your home screen. That's it! If you want to find an app that is not in the list you need to open app drawer and see all the fancy icons again!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id144720182"}, "name":{"label":"Anne Ermens"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-22T15:25:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"11863704166"}, "title":{"label":"Looks wonderful"}, "content":{"label":"I feel more calm then ever when I look at my phone. I’m Dutch but the tutorials in English were easy to follow. Only issue I have; when I want to open an app while using the widget, it first opens shortcuts screen before it automatically opens the app I selected. That’s a little annoying. But well done and I’m looking forward to the updates!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id1303624168"}, "name":{"label":"TuJiVanOers"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-14T13:02:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"11834282768"}, "title":{"label":"The app looks good"}, "content":{"label":"The bad reviews sucks because I want to see the app at full potential, I hope people will still give it a try. So thats why I will give it a 5 star. Because the app works fine. If you have a IQ above 2 peanuts and 5.7 chickens everything should be easy to set-up. It will take time, but it is easy.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id283159910"}, "name":{"label":"Rob02N"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-04T19:26:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"11798420436"}, "title":{"label":"Not sure what this is doing in top 3 productivity"}, "content":{"label":"Downloaded this app to decrease screen time; but took more than 30 minutes to set up properly with vague tutorials. There’s no direct link to productivity apps like Notion, so you have to use a URL scheme to program this yourself. After finally setting it up correctly I found out that url schemes are laggy. This app is not production ready, serving its purpose or doing anything good. Hopefully my 6 euro’s are used to improve this app for people who download it in the future.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
