{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id1160871170"}, "name":{"label":"TMW_99"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-06-27T02:36:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"11428430473"}, "title":{"label":"Huge help in a focused life"}, "content":{"label":"Dumbify does exactly what you want it to do: make your homescreen less distracting and more straightforward. For me, Dumbify is a huge help in my pursuit to a more focused life!\n\nThe developer responds very quickly. Within the app are clear instruction manuals and videos to help you get started.\n\nAfter using it for a few days I can already say that it is well worth the price. I’m never going back.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
