{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id256001139"}, "name":{"label":"Essential reviews"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-06-16T02:48:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"11387236547"}, "title":{"label":"Less distactions"}, "content":{"label":"I like the app, it reduces distractions. You can do quite a lot when also combined with siri shortcuts and focus modes to make your phone usage very intentional. Is it also possible to have a full dark / black background instead of the grey background?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id228147386"}, "name":{"label":"Martijnox"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-06-11T07:27:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"11369244210"}, "title":{"label":"Just perfect!"}, "content":{"label":"The app works as it’s supposed to, and it works incredibly well for me. No distractions, but still the option to use certain apps when necessary (what a dumb phone can’t do). \nI’d like some more apps to be added, but you can add many yourself already and even request certain apps. Developer seems very active and responsive, much appreciated!\nWorks as good as competitor apps (if not better) and I love the non-subscription, one time payment. Thanks a lot!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
